  "contentHtml": "<p>한 학급만 과학탐구실험 수업시간이 남아서 취미는 과학의 &quot;미생물, 어디까지 들어봤니?&quot;를 보면서 간단한 퀴즈 활동지를 만들었습니다.&#160;</p><p>같이 과탐실 하시는 선생님이 제미나이로 만드셨습니다.&#160;</p><p>내용이 너무 재미있어 학생들이 몰입감이 높습니다.&#160;</p><p>1시간동안 보여줘야 해서.. 1.25배속으로 시청했습니다.&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>과탐실 뿐만 아니라, 생명과학시간에도 보여주면 좋을 것 같습니다.&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a7e057a81c50a045bbfbede34f538e9985cb0ffc?download\" data-file-name=\"미생물 영상 활동지(수정).pdf\" data-file-size=\"71774\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DcTdL%26dataid%3D451%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20260513155103&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fa7e057a81c50a045bbfbede34f538e9985cb0ffc')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">미생물 영상 활동지(수정)</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">70.09KB</div></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>영상링크</p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=StYWJLxlQWQ\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=StYWJLxlQWQ</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=StYWJLxlQWQ\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"869\" data-video-height=\"489\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/mv9YQ/dJMb9g5fUPF/XynurwNc33x525YTKj3Id1/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=196_164_1148_472,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/hhsTt/dJMb9iILM0J/Ko2EBpZBgMp4PoZiA5tIr0/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=196_164_1148_472\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"869\" data-video-origin-height=\"489\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/StYWJLxlQWQ\" width=\"869\" height=\"489\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></i